  "summary": "In 1968 the Maytals, led by Toots Hibbert, released \"Do the Reggay\". Bostonia says Hibbert coined the term reggae with that hit, and the Recording Academy calls him the first known artist to use the word on a record. The band had formed in Kingston, Jamaica, in 1962.",
